  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nStep into the epitome of luxury with the MCY 86 Motor Yacht “BAYC ASIA”. With the beautiful design and cozy spaces, it's the perfect choice for the ultimate vacation with your friends or family.\n\nShe was built in 2015 and refitted in 2023. Now, she boasts impeccable condition, featuring numerous upgrades, replacements, and a tastefully designed interior. \n\nBAYC ASIA, featuring 4 guest cabins with private bathrooms and accommodation for 8 overnight guests, stands out as a top choice for your holiday charter. \n\nShe boasts an unmatched outdoor space including a bow lounge, fully covered flybridge, and a large cockpit.\n\nAn advanced stabilizing system reduces the side-to-side roll for guests whether at anchor or underway. This yacht is equipped with a hydraulic bathing platform for easy water access and a water maker to enhance your on-board experience. \n\nDiscover exciting day trips with the MCY 86 around Phuket. Or take time to explore all the gems of the Andaman Sea on a long charter.",
